y two\">\n      <p>当社会结构书变换观念才能适应立法保留的[?]，政治</p>\n      <p>推行立法时，一方面会被才有的机遇破坏，另一方面</p>\n      <p>面不可能建立起有效的法律秩序，使人们对“法能</p>\n      <p>主动限制。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-heading\">\n      <span class=\"chapter\">第十章</span>无为政治\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"term\">长期</div>\n\n    <div class=\"mark three\"></div>\n    <div class=\"entry three\">\n      <p>最权谟毅助 政变对内在的机制，无论任何规则</p>\n      <p>模块理，所以会采用“无为”的立法秩序。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"subentry intro\">\n      <p><span class=\"bullet\"></span>有限权力强调从两方面看：</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"subentry first\">\n      <p><span class=\"bullet\"></span>1社会冲突<span class=\"arrow\">⇒</span>有暴露权力：在此没有限权力的保证，人们遇到代际</p>\n      <p>或状态的冲突中捍卫，仍然是法律和秩序。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"subentry second\">\n      <p><span class=\"bullet\"></span>2社会合作<span class=\"arrow\">⇒</span>同意权力：每个人对保障自己的正当权，不得不服从</p>\n      <p>同意的合作内工作，同盟破坏认同他的内部合作，这</p>\n      <p>就产生了权力斗争。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faint a\">[illegible]<br>[illegible]</div>\n    <div class=\"faint b\">[illegible]<br>[illegible]</div>\n    <div class=\"faint c\">[illegible]<br>[illegible]</div>\n    <div class=\"faint d\">[illegible]<br>[illegible]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom-label\">总结：</div>\n\n    <div class=\"hole h1\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h2\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h3\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h4\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h5\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h6\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h7\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h8\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h9\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h10\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h11\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h12\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h13\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h14\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h15\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h16\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h17\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole h18\"></div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
